      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that it would be better to run this test on a real system. But, as you mentioned, the CI only seems to run on Linux today. \n\nI couldn\u0027t find any evidence that the upstream changes run on Windows or Mac and I don\u0027t see anything hinting the existence of nightly builds either. I looked in https://ci.eclipse.org/jgit/ and I can only see that there are CI jobs for Windows but they are disabled.\n\nBecause of this, I can\u0027t use `Assume(FS.isCaseSensitive())` because that would disable the test for Linux, the only system running the tests today.\n\n@matthias.sohn@sap.com if any of my assumptions here are wrong and there *are* tests running on Windows and/or Mac, please let me know and I\u0027ll change the test.",
